From 3be57a461329c083859a3fc83499aa7577d28b95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:19:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/15] Show the user's professionals and next appointment on
 the dashboard

A new dashboard card, first in the list, shows who follows the user on
ALMOVA (training, physiotherapy, nutrition) and the next scheduled
appointment with one of them. The data comes over REST from the server's
care endpoints: open follow-ups as patient and scheduled appointments from
now on, limited to those follow-ups since the user may be a professional
as well. The card stays hidden offline, when nobody follows the user and
on servers without these endpoints. It can be hidden in the dashboard
settings like the other cards; stored arrangements get it appended.

Texts in English and Portuguese (pt, pt_BR), with the wording of the web
app.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
